  <dc:description>Provides types for managing access and audit control lists for files and directories.

Commonly Used Types:
System.Security.AccessControl.DirectoryObjectSecurity
System.Security.AccessControl.DirectorySecurity
System.Security.AccessControl.FileSecurity
System.Security.AccessControl.FileSystemAccessRule
System.Security.AccessControl.FileSystemAuditRule
System.Security.AccessControl.FileSystemRights
System.Security.AccessControl.FileSystemSecurity
 
When using NuGet 3.x this package requires at least version 3.4.</dc:description>
